## New APIs

```c#
namespace J2N
{
    public static class Character
    {
        public static int ToChars(int codePoint, Span<char> destination, int destinationIndex)
        public static int ToChars(int codePoint, out char high, out char low)
        public static string ToString(ReadOnlySpan<int> codePoints)
        public static string ToString(ReadOnlySpan<int> codePoints, int startIndex, int length)
    }
}
```

## Performance Optimizations

- [PERFORMANCE: J2N.Text.StringBuilderExtensions::AppendCodePoint(): Use the ToChars() overload that doesn't allocate.](https://github.com/NightOwl888/J2N/commit/f9dc379efc24b78878bf7324d5f35d0b8352b6f8)
- [PERFORMANCE: J2N.Text.StringExtensions::IndexOf(): Eliminated array allocation in call to Character.ToChars()](https://github.com/NightOwl888/J2N/commit/50903cd6dac631f406288228a30aea2a81332540)
- [PERFORMANCE: J2N.Text.StringExtensions::LastIndexOf(): Eliminated array allocation in call to Character.ToChars()](https://github.com/NightOwl888/J2N/commit/41d0e25d5b99d7f5c41712a4c2a75a81e9611994)
- [PERFORMANCE: J2N.Character::GetType(): Optimized codePoint lookup by cascading the call when supported in .NET](https://github.com/NightOwl888/J2N/commit/cb80ccd6b8e6d0a5e86ab5269e66820e0296b06a)

